SUMMARY:Appalachian Renegades at Mills River Brewing
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Social Club\n**Hey y’all! Come join us at Mills Ri
 ver Brewing for some time of socializing and great live music from the App
 alachian Renegades! This is a great local band and you won’t wanna miss 
 their show!**\n\n**Music starts at 6:30! Come out at 5:00 for a time of so
 cializing before the music starts. Hope to see you there!**\n\n**WE ARE AP
 ALACHIAN RENEGADES**\n**A rock band that fuses classic sounds and modern t
 ones\, The Appalachian Renegades call upon guitar heavy riffs mixed with s
 oaring saxophone melodies and clean vocals to form their core sound. Havin
 g spent 7 years playing shows across WNC\, the renegades are currently wri
 ting music for their 4th studio release. Devil's Wish\, the third of their
  career\, had two #1 singles in the summer of 2022 on Buzz Radio Asheville
 . The guys produce a sound reminiscent of rock bands like Greta Van Fleet\
 , Clutch\, Volbeat\, Government Mule\, Jack White\, Black Stone Cherry\, a
 nd My Morning Jacket among many other influential contemporary and classic
  rock artists.**\n\n**Vocals\, Guitar\, Saxophone / Graeme Adams**\n**Lead
  Guitar\, Vocals / Cole Ford**\n**Bass / Brent Fleurry**\n**Drums / Larry 
 Smith**\n\n**https://www.millsriverbrewingco.com/**
